      "heading": "A — Exam authority",
      "learner_facing": true,
      "markdown": "## A — Exam authority, Section Fourteen Additional Safety Tips\n\nThis dossier supports first-time never-licensed applicants preparing for the Class C non-commercial knowledge test in Texas. The issuing authority is the Texas Department of Public Safety, Driver License Division, and the source is the Texas Driver Handbook. The official question count, test format, time limit, and passing standard are not stated on the assigned pages, so this dossier asserts no value for any of them. Practice scoring follows only the accepted LearningLoop product policy.\n",
